==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Znache]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 5~6.67 seconds<sup>150f~200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zroco]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 30~60 seconds<sup>900f~1,800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zir Zeal]]s spawn after 200 seconds<sup>6,000f</sup>, delay 66.67~133.33 seconds<sup>2,000f~4,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zackie Peng]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 30~60 seconds<sup>900f~1,800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zomboe]]s spawn after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>, delay 30~60 seconds<sup>900f~1,800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zigge]]s spawn after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>, delay 30~60 seconds<sup>900f~1,800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zigge]]s spawn after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>, delay 30~60 seconds<sup>900f~1,800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**3 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 3.33~5 seconds<sup>100f~150f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Zir Zeal]] spawns.
*When the base reaches 70% HP:
**1 [[Zir Zeal]] spawns.
*When the base reaches 50% HP:
**3 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 1.67~3.33 seconds<sup>50f~100f</sup>.
**1 [[Zir Zeal]] spawns.
*When the base reaches 30% HP:
**1 [[Zir Zeal]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Spam any cats with the [[Zombie Killer]] ability. Rushing this stage is not too much of an issue, since most Zombie threats will burrow under your main line of attack.

